- Loop blocks should preserve a backward flow together with an exit path
- For retry-validation loops, realize the structure as:
  validation action -> decision question -> retry branch back to validation -> success branch forward to the exit action
- Simple retry loops should not introduce an explicit merge unless multiple forward branches truly rejoin later
